			<item>
				<title>Exploring BodaPest</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/sightseeing/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/sightseeing/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;While you are here for our cruise wedding, we highly recommend setting coordinates for these iconic locations around town:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;attraction-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/parliament.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The Hungarian Parliament reflected in the Danube&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;The Hungarian Parliament Building&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;An architectural marvel visible right from the Danube.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hungarian_Parliament_Building_2023-9.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Pierre Blaché&#xA;                (CC0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/fishermans-bastion-pinterest.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Fisherman&amp;#39;s Bastion overlooking the Danube and Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Buda Castle &amp;amp; Fisherman&amp;#39;s Bastion&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Scale the hill for a sweeping panoramic view over the entire city.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ph.pinterest.com/pin/641059328208145770/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Pinterest pin&#xA;                (Source)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/szechenyi-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The outdoor pools at Széchenyi Thermal Bath&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Széchenyi Thermal Bath&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;The ultimate place to relax and unwind before the big celebration.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sz%C3%A9chenyi_thermal_bath,_Budapest.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Slyronit&#xA;                (CC BY-SA 4.0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/veli-bej-historic.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Historic view of the Császár bath complex associated with Veli Bej&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Veli Bej Thermal Bath&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;A restored 16th-century Ottoman bath in Budapest&amp;#39;s historic Császár bath complex.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Budapest_II.,_%C3%81rp%C3%A1d_fejedelem_%C3%BAtja_%28%C3%9Ajlaki_rakpart%29,_Cs%C3%A1sz%C3%A1r_f%C3%BCrd%C5%91._Fortepan_28832.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Fortepan 28832&#xA;                (CC BY-SA 3.0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/rudas-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Rudas Baths and Gellért Hill in Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Rudas Thermal Bath&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;A historic Turkish bath with a distinctive domed pool and views across the Danube.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rudas_Baths_central_part_and_Gellert_Hill_in_Tab%C3%A1n,_2016_Budapest.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Globetrotter19&#xA;                (CC BY-SA 3.0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
